OL,3,GNEWSABoy drowned while 'lake jumping',
OL,4,Ainquest concludes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy who drowned in
OL,7,FLeicestershire had been "lake jumping"
OL,8,Fwith a group of friends before getting
OL,9,Finto difficulty, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FHayden Jones-Powell disappeared after
OL,12,Fgoing into Meynell Lake, off Fosse Way
OL,13,Fin Syston, shortly before 13:00 BST on
OL,14,F25 June.
OL,16,FOn Friday, an inquest into his death
OL,17,Fheard he had been with a group of 15
OL,18,Fpeople after Wreake Valley Academy,
OL,19,Fwhere he was a pupil, closed early due
OL,20,Fto hot weather.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
