OL,3,GNEWSABoy drowned while 'lake jumping',
OL,4,Ainquest concludes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsobel Thistlethwaite, assistant
OL,7,Fcoroner for Rutland and North
OL,8,FLeicestershire, concluded the teenager
OL,9,Fdied as the result of an accident.
